ich began as a popular audio comedy series spoofing role-playing games and fantasy tropes. It marks the first time the story reaches English-speaking players, and also its first appearance as a game. You lead seven classic fantasy archetypes, including a Ranger, an Elf, a Dwarf, a Barbarian, a Magician and an Ogre, who barely tolerate each other while hunting a dungeon's treasure.\n\nTheir skills complement each other as they level up, so building a balanced team matters. The tone is silly and self-aware, which suits players who enjoy fantasy parody, quirky characters and tactical party combat. It is single-player with full controller support."}}